Spec: Typed secure stream control contracts

Purpose:
  Share bounded secure-open and local permission request shapes with signature-pinned Android clients.

Owns:
  ./SecureReply.java

References:
  ./WireJson.sdd
  ./ControlReply.sdd

Must:
  Require application-saved operation IDs and exact scope fields; never encode an arbitrary transport target.
  Validate response correlation, fixed state/error fields and immutable typed results before delivering handles.
  Keep experimental secure methods distinct from the unfinished full product connection API.

  Encode explicit experimental relay opens separately from direct opens; accept only fixed direct/relay paths and a bounded relay failure code.
